      "id": "sol.ahsme-1965-p10.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We have \\(x^2-x-6=(x-3)(x+2).\\) This product is negative exactly between its roots, so \\(-2\\lt x\\lt3.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is A.",
